# Never commit game-derived files: disc images, executables, generated code, builds, captures.
*.iso
*.chd
*.cso
*.7z
*.zip
*.elf
*.irx
*.afs
*.raw
*.pcap
*.ppm
generated/
build/
games/
tools/emsdk/
# Secrets and private config
*.pem
*.key
*.env
!*.env.example
local.properties
net/runs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
